  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT ACCURATE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096 (analyzer 9.2.0): the item's `rtl/a.v` still emits only `module a` + file node. verilog.py symbol arms: `module_declaration` (L158), `interface_declaration` (L185); edges: `module_instantiation` only (L262). The installed tree-sitter-verilog grammar yields `task_declaration`, `function_declaration`, `net_declaration` nodes for the repro. A task enable `run;` and a call `f(1)` in an `initial` block emit no edge, resolved or unresolved. `FLAT_LANGUAGES[\"verilog\"]` is at test_stable_id_floor_gate.py L1538. Separate defect seen, outside this item: single-port and empty-port instantiations emit no `instantiates` edge (grammar node is `checker_instantiation`). Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-bodug.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # 18c3
