- op: discuss  # 6ddf
  at: '2026-11-16T04:57:53Z'  # 6ddf
  by: agent  # 6ddf
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6ddf
  clock: 5  # 6ddf
  nonce: 6ddf  # 6ddf
  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. Re-ran the item's rtl/a.v: it now emits the task, the function and the nets as symbols (kinds task, function, signal) under their module, wherever declared. Function calls emit calls edges (lexical scope, imports, pkg::f) and a module nothing instantiates is marked an entrypoint, so a function called from a module body is reachable; on the 8-file fixture dead-code went from 13 of 13 dead to 11 (10 really uncalled). 0 declared stable ids gone. NOT measured on real code: no Verilog/SystemVerilog repository is cloned on this machine (one 32-line file in meson). Left: reg/logic variables, user-typed nets, out-of-block methods, packages/classes/programs as symbols; task enables do not parse in tree-sitter-verilog 1.0.3, so tasks get no incoming edge."  # 6ddf
